        "language": "english",
        "review": "God, I love pigeons.\nThey deserve so much more love.\nI’m always so happy when they get their time to shine.\n\nThe game is super cute – the pigeons are adorable, the customization is fun, and I really got attached to a few of mine. It’s nice that the game remembers which one I like most.\nThe story is simple but quite sweet. The different areas are nice, the puzzle rather easy but still fun. It’s cozy, and a bit silly, because, well, pigeons.\n\nIt’s not bug-free, and I had to restart my game a few times, but the devs are really active and helpful and keep improving things. It’s already much better than it was at release.\n\nI hope we get more pigeons in the future – more colors, hats, maybe even new shapes. I already have too many, the screen is full of them. But imo that’s exactly how it should be.\n\n(● )>　　　<(● )\n|=|　　♥　　 |=| \n( \\ ||/>　　　( \\ ||/>\n] [　　　 　　] [",
